OL,3,GNEWSAPlanning breaches unsatisfactory,
OL,4,Aminister says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe failure by owners of a former
OL,7,Frestaurant site to comply with
OL,8,Fenforcement notices "may be a criminal
OL,9,Foffence", according to a Jersey
OL,10,Fminister.
OL,12,FPlanning and Regulation Minister Sir
OL,13,FMark Boleat described the situation
OL,14,Fwith the former Nude Dunes restaurant
OL,15,Fas "unsatisfactory" and something his
OL,16,Fdepartment was "grappling with".
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
