OL,3,GNEWSAPlanning breaches unsatisfactory,
OL,4,Aminister says
OL,5,
OL,6,FNude Dunes at La Pulente in St Ouen's
OL,7,FBay closed down as a restaurant in
OL,8,FNovember 2023 and in 2025 enforcement
OL,9,Fnotices were issued in relation to the
OL,10,Fsite being used as a home and the
OL,11,Funauthorised erection of a fence and
OL,12,Fmodular structure.
OL,14,FSite owner Nadia Miller declined to
OL,15,Fcomment when approached by the BBC.
